e shows an intermediate failed recovery state on node1 (forwarding=1, vlan-access.service initially inactive) that was only resolved after manual intervention; this nuance is understated in the executor's summary."]},"ttft_ms":55190,"type":"result","duration_ms":99734,"uuid":"985d631d-6d9f-4904-94ab-3c10ceca017f","ttft_stream_ms":1165,"time_to_request_ms":37,"first_content_frame_ms":1897,"queued_turn_count":0}
